{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a product catalog API behind an API gateway, with RDS for the catalog and OSS for images. Elasticsearch is excluded per your legal team."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ecs","rds","tair","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing marketplace API","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k API consumers","alt":"Over 100k API consumers"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Marketplace clients","group":"internet","why":"Apps and browsers calling the catalog API."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the API domain to the ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Catalog VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Terminates TLS and routes traffic into the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Rate limiting, auth and routing for the catalog API."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gw","from":"alb","to":"gw"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Catalog API servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the product catalog business logic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-app","from":"gw","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Product cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches hot product lookups to reduce DB load."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Catalog database","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores products, categories and pricing."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores and serves product photos via signed URLs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes API access logs and error traces."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How should product images be delivered to end users?","options":["Direct from OSS","Via CDN or ESA edge cache"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"search-need","text":"Do you need full-text product search beyond simple SQL queries?","options":["No, SQL filters are enough","Yes, we need text search"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Product catalog API with Cloud-native API Gateway, ECS, Tair cache, RDS database and OSS image storage in Singapore."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add OpenSearch for fast full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions, keeping Elasticsearch excluded per your legal team."}
{"t":"req","text":"Elasticsearch is banned due to licensing concerns","avoid":["elasticsearch"]}
{"t":"node","id":"search","product":"opensearch","label":"Product search index","group":"vpc","why":"Full-text and fuzzy search over product titles and descriptions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-search","from":"app","to":"search","label":"search"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added OpenSearch for full-text and fuzzy product search; Elasticsearch remains excluded per legal policy."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a claims portal in Tokyo with RDS for data and OSS for documents, fronted by ESA and ALB with WAF."}
{"t":"req","text":"All policyholder data must remain physically within Japan","regions":["ap-northeast-1"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls","certificate-management","kms"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing portal for policyholders","alt":"Internal only via corporate network"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 50k policyholders","alt":"Over 500k policyholders"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Policyholders","group":"internet","why":"Insurance customers submitting claims."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the portal domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates and secures portal access from Japan."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"tokyo","kind":"region","label":"Tokyo (ap-northeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Claims VPC","parent":"tokyo"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes HTTPS traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"cert","product":"certificate-management","label":"TLS certificate","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Terminates TLS at the load balancer."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks injection and bot attacks on the portal."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Portal servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the claims application in two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales servers during peak claim periods."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Claims metadata goes to RDS and uploaded documents to OSS, both encrypted with KMS."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Claims DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores claims records with zone-level HA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Claim documents","group":"tokyo","why":"Stores policyholder uploads like photos and PDFs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-docs","from":"app","to":"docs","label":"upload"}
{"t":"node","id":"kms","product":"kms","label":"KMS","group":"tokyo","why":"Encrypts database and document storage at rest."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-kms","from":"db","to":"kms","kind":"control","label":"encrypt"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-kms","from":"docs","to":"kms","kind":"control","label":"encrypt"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"tokyo","why":"Centralizes audit and access logs in Tokyo."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"doc-size","text":"How large are typical claim document uploads?","options":["Under 10 MB each","10-50 MB each","Over 50 MB each"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"auth-method","text":"How will policyholders authenticate?","options":["Email and password","SMS OTP","Corporate SSO"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Claims portal in Tokyo with ESA, ALB plus WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, RDS, OSS and KMS encryption."}

{"t":"say","text":"Data residency requires all policyholder data to stay in Tokyo, so I cannot replicate the claims database to Singapore."}
{"t":"say","text":"Instead, the analytics team can access dashboards that query a read-only RDS replica within Tokyo over a private CEN link."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg-analytics","kind":"external","label":"Singapore Analytics Team","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"analysts","product":"users","label":"Analytics users","group":"sg-analytics","why":"Team in Singapore viewing dashboards."}
{"t":"node","id":"read-replica","product":"rds","label":"Claims read replica","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Read-only copy for reporting, stays in Tokyo per residency rule."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-db-read-replica","from":"db","to":"read-replica","label":"replication","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"bi","product":"quick-bi","label":"Quick BI dashboards","group":"tokyo","why":"Reporting dashboards querying the Tokyo read replica."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-read-replica-bi","from":"read-replica","to":"bi","label":"SQL","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"cen","product":"cen","label":"CEN","group":null,"why":"Private network linking Singapore office to Tokyo VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-analysts-cen","from":"analysts","to":"cen","label":"private"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-cen-bi","from":"cen","to":"bi","label":"dashboard"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Cannot replicate data to Singapore due to Japan residency rule; added a Tokyo read replica with Quick BI accessed privately via CEN."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll add a Qwen chatbot to the portal. Model Studio runs in Tokyo, so all policyholder data stays in Japan."}
{"t":"node","id":"ai-gw","product":"ai-gateway","label":"AI Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Routes and rate-limits chatbot calls to Qwen models"}
{"t":"node","id":"qwen","product":"model-studio","label":"Qwen via Model Studio","group":"tokyo","why":"Hosted Qwen model answering policyholder questions"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-ai-gw","from":"app","to":"ai-gw","label":"chat"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ai-gw-qwen","from":"ai-gw","to":"qwen","label":"LLM API"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added AI Gateway in the VPC and Model Studio (Qwen) in Tokyo for the portal chatbot, keeping all data in Japan."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw Dify on ACK in Frankfurt, calling Qwen via Model Studio and reading company documents from OSS."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ack","dify-on-ack","acr","model-studio","oss","rds","tair","nat","sls"]}
{"t":"req","text":"Deploy in Frankfurt region","regions":["eu-central-1"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internal users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Company staff accessing the internal knowledge assistant."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the internal assistant domain to ALB."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"frankfurt","kind":"region","label":"Frankfurt (eu-central-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Dify VPC","parent":"frankfurt"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes internal traffic to the Dify cluster across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Managed Kubernetes hosting the Dify containers."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-ack","from":"alb","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"dify","product":"dify-on-ack","label":"Dify","group":"vpc","why":"Self-hosted RAG and agent platform serving employees."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-dify","from":"ack","to":"dify"}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"frankfurt","why":"Stores the custom Dify container images for ACK."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-acr","from":"ack","to":"acr","kind":"control","label":"pull"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Gives Dify outbound access to Model Studio APIs."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-nat","from":"ack","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"model","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"frankfurt","why":"Provides hosted Qwen models for Dify inference."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-nat-model","from":"nat","to":"model","label":"API"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Company documents","group":"frankfurt","why":"Object storage holding internal documents for RAG ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-docs","from":"dify","to":"docs","label":"read"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Dify metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores Dify workflows, configs and app metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-db","from":"dify","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Caches sessions and speeds up vector lookups."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-cache","from":"dify","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"frankfurt","why":"Collects Dify and ACK logs for monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-dify-logs","from":"dify","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"vector-store","text":"Which vector store do you want for Dify's RAG pipeline?","options":["Elasticsearch","Milvus","OpenSearch"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"auth","text":"How should employees authenticate to the assistant?","options":["SSO via IDaaS","Basic auth","No auth yet"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Dify self-hosted on ACK in Frankfurt, with ALB ingress, Model Studio for Qwen, OSS for documents, RDS and Tair."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a private Jakarta setup with managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL, reachable from your data center over Express Connect."}
{"t":"req","text":"Databases stay in Jakarta region","regions":["ap-southeast-5"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["onprem-dc","express-connect","vpc","mongodb","rds","privatezone"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"dedicated-link","text":"Express Connect for dedicated private link","alt":"VPN Gateway for quicker setup"}
{"t":"group","id":"onprem","kind":"onprem","label":"Your Data Center","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"onprem-dc","label":"SaaS App Servers","group":"onprem","why":"Application servers running in your own facility."}
{"t":"group","id":"jakarta","kind":"region","label":"Jakarta (ap-southeast-5)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Private DB VPC","parent":"jakarta"}
{"t":"node","id":"vbr","product":"express-connect","label":"Express Connect VBR","group":"vpc","why":"Dedicated private link endpoint into the VPC."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-vbr","from":"app","to":"vbr","label":"private link","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"mongo","product":"mongodb","label":"Managed MongoDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Document store for SaaS platform data."}
{"t":"node","id":"postgres","product":"rds","label":"RDS PostgreSQL","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational store for structured SaaS data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-vbr-mongo","from":"vbr","to":"mongo","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-vbr-postgres","from":"vbr","to":"postgres","label":"private","kind":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"privatezone","label":"PrivateZone","group":"vpc","why":"Resolves database endpoints privately inside the VPC."}
{"t":"ask","id":"db-scale","text":"What scale do you expect for the databases?","options":["Small dev/test","Medium production","Large enterprise"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"backup-region","text":"Do you need cross-region disaster recovery backups?","options":["No, Jakarta only","Yes, add Singapore replica"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Private Jakarta VPC with managed MongoDB and RDS PostgreSQL, connected to your data center via Express Connect with no public exposure."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a live-streaming platform with Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubbing traffic before ESA, then ALB to app servers and cache."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","anti-ddos-proxy","esa","alb","waf","ecs","tair","oss","live","sls"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"region","text":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1) region","alt":"Another region"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 50k concurrent viewers","alt":"Over 200k concurrent viewers"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Viewers","group":"internet","why":"People watching the live streams."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves platform domain to Anti-DDoS Proxy."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"anti-ddos","product":"anti-ddos-proxy","label":"Anti-DDoS Proxy","group":"edge","why":"Scrubs large L3-L7 DDoS attacks before traffic reaches ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-anti-ddos","from":"users","to":"anti-ddos","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches static assets, accelerates dynamic API calls and provides WAF bot defense."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-anti-ddos-esa","from":"anti-ddos","to":"esa","label":"scrubbed"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Streaming VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Distributes HTTP/HTTPS traffic across app servers in two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks and bots at the load balancer."}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs streaming business logic, chat and user sessions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores viewer sessions, room state and hot metadata."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"say","text":"Live ingest goes through ApsaraVideo Live, with stream recordings stored in OSS and logs in SLS."}
{"t":"node","id":"live","product":"live","label":"ApsaraVideo Live","group":"sg","why":"Ingests, transcodes and distributes live video streams."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-live","from":"app","to":"live","label":"control","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Stream recordings","group":"sg","why":"Stores recorded streams and thumbnails."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-live-media","from":"live","to":"media","label":"recordings"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralizes access logs and security events for analysis."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-logs","from":"alb","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"stream-type","text":"What type of live streams do you host?","options":["Gaming / esports","E-commerce shopping","Events and webinars","Mixed content"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"attack-type","text":"Which attacks hit you most often?","options":["Volumetric DDoS","Application layer (CC)","Bot scraping","All of the above"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Live-streaming architecture with Anti-DDoS Proxy scrubbing into ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS app servers and Tair cache."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a photo-sharing backend with ECS behind an ALB, RDS for metadata, and OSS for images. No Function Compute."}
{"t":"req","text":"No serverless functions allowed","avoid":["fc"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","ecs","ess","rds","oss","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"exposure","text":"Public-facing app","alt":"Internal only"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"About 10k users","alt":"Over 100k users"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"App users","group":"internet","why":"Users uploading and viewing photos."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the app domain to the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"App VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Routes HTTP traffic across two zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"App servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the photo-sharing API on ECS instances."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Scales ECS instances based on CPU or traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Photos are stored in OSS, metadata like tags and comments in RDS."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Metadata DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores user data, photo metadata and comments."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"images","product":"oss","label":"Photo storage","group":"sg","why":"Stores uploaded images durably."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-images","from":"app","to":"images","label":"upload/read"}
{"t":"node","id":"nat","product":"nat","label":"NAT Gateway","group":"vpc","why":"Provides outbound internet for ECS updates."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-nat","from":"app","to":"nat","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Collects application logs for debugging."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"ask","id":"image-delivery","text":"How should users view photos?","options":["Direct from OSS via signed URLs","Through ESA/CDN edge cache","Through the ECS app servers"]}
{"t":"ask","id":"db-engine","text":"Which database engine do you prefer?","options":["MySQL","PostgreSQL"]}
{"t":"done","summary":"Photo-sharing backend with ECS behind ALB, RDS for metadata, OSS for images, and no serverless functions."}

{"t":"say","text":"Since Function Compute is forbidden, I'll add an ECS worker that polls OSS for new photos and generates thumbnails."}
{"t":"node","id":"worker","product":"ecs","label":"Thumbnail workers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Polls OSS for new uploads and generates thumbnails without serverless functions."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-worker-images","from":"worker","to":"images","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-worker-logs","from":"worker","to":"logs","kind":"control","label":"logs"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Added ECS thumbnail workers that poll OSS to generate thumbnails, respecting the no-serverless policy."}

{"t":"say","text":"한국 개인정보보호법에 따라 모든 데이터를 서울 리전에 유지하는 게임 서버 아키텍처를 구성하겠습니다."}
{"t":"req","text":"이용자 개인정보 해외 반출 금지, 서울 리전 필수","regions":["ap-northeast-2"]}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls","nat"]}
{"t":"assume","id":"game-type","text":"HTTP 기반 웹/모바일 게임 서버","alt":"TCP/UDP 기반 실시간 게임"}
{"t":"assume","id":"scale","text":"동시 접속 약 1만 명 규모","alt":"동시 접속 10만 명 이상"}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"인터넷","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"플레이어","group":"internet","why":"게임에 접속하는 이용자"}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Alibaba Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"게임 도메인을 ALB로 해석"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"seoul","kind":"region","label":"Seoul (ap-northeast-2)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"게임 VPC","parent":"seoul"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"두 가용영역으로 트래픽 분산"}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"DDoS 및 웹 공격 차단"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"game-server","product":"ecs","label":"게임 서버","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"두 가용영역에 배포된 게임 로직"}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"game-server","why":"접속자 수에 따른 자동 확장"}
